  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/P1190280.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(60 fotos) Poco despu&eacute;s de las 18 horas de este viernes, la reina infantil de Fira d&#39;Onda 2015, Julia Mart&iacute;nez Samaniego, con su corte de honor y el alcalde, Ximo Huguet Lecha, han inaugurado la feria de atracciones, que vuelve a su recinto de la calle Manuel Sanchis Guarner, junto a la avenida Sierra Espad&aacute;n, tras cuatro a&ntilde;os de ausencia.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p1190268.jpg\" alt=\"p1190268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p1190269.jpg\" alt=\"p1190269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p1190270.jpg\" alt=\"p1190270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p1190271.jpg\" alt=\"p1190271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p1190272.jpg\" alt=\"p1190272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p1190273.jpg\" alt=\"p1190273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p1190274.jpg\" alt=\"p1190274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p1190275.jpg\" alt=\"p1190275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaatraccionsfiraonda15/p11